📝 To-Do Application (Django + REST API)

A full-stack To-Do List web application developed using Django and Django REST Framework (DRF) that allows users to 
efficiently manage daily tasks through a clean, responsive, and interactive interface.

🚀 Project Overview

The To-Do Application enables users to add, view, update, and delete tasks seamlessly. 
The backend is built using Django REST Framework, which provides structured and scalable REST APIs. 
These APIs are consumed by the frontend using JavaScript (Fetch/AJAX) to ensure smooth and asynchronous operations without reloading the page.

This project demonstrates a clear separation between frontend and backend, following modern full-stack development practices.
